# MATCHLINE | 05: bounded observation (no orders are submitted here)
# Select `local` in IntelliJ HTTP Client.

### JSON engine metrics — no per-order labels
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/metrics

> {%
  client.test("metrics JSON contract", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected 200");
    client.assert(response.body.writer !== undefined, "Expected writer counters");
    client.assert(response.body.processingNanos !== undefined, "Expected processing histogram");
  });
%}

### Prometheus exposition format
GET {{baseUrl}}/metrics

> {%
  client.test("metrics endpoint responds", function () {
    client.assert(response.status === 200, "Expected 200");
  });
%}

### Existing status — includes live queue size, no extra load generator
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/status
